---
/**
 * Inline SVG icon set.
 *
 * Deliberately hand-rolled instead of pulling in an icon package: this ships
 * ~4 KB of paths instead of a dependency plus tree-shaking config, and every
 * icon inherits `currentColor` so theming comes free.
 *
 * `IconName` is derived from the PATHS object rather than declared separately,
 * so adding an icon is a one-line change and a typo in a `name` prop becomes a
 * type error instead of a silently missing glyph.
 */
